# Take a message
@scenario office_lesson_22
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk present]
pip: A teammate texts the office. The thread has an identity separate from its display title.
pip: Open config/phone/phone.properties. Rename the chat and keep its ID, then inspect the phone preview.
> Read the office chat -> messages
> Try the checkpoint -> check
@label messages
[phone contact pip name="Pip"]
[phone thread office title="Office chat" participants=player,pip]
[if !office_welcome_sent]
[phone message office pip "I left a spare key in your desk. See you tomorrow!" time=17:10]
[flag office_welcome_sent]
[endif]
[phone open chat office]
pip: Close the chat with its back control when you have read the note.
[phone close]
@label check
pip: Which identifier should incoming messages target?
> Whatever title is currently displayed. -> retry
> The stable chat ID. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: The ID routes the message even after the title is translated. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: The ID routes the message even after the title is translated.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_22]
[flag tutorial_done_22]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
